# A tall canvas of a seated man (issue 076, from one of Marc's unhung pieces, a loose impression of a genre painting in the manner of an old magazine illustration): cream edge, a big pale poster on the wall behind with two short dark marks standing for a line of print and a faint head drawn on it, a figure in light trousers and a dark tie slouched on a red chair, dark shoes, a checkered floor, warm cream and brown. No readable text, no likeness. 32x16 wall slot, tall frame centred.
size: 32x16
